From 7c1d959166c73855ca2399dc498b87c634d3dac7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: road-trip-loop <loop@road-trip-game.local>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 06:18:05 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] Fishing core (F2): species by water / time / weather,
 shadows, cast, bite, fight, catch

- src/core/fishing/species.ts: the first chapter's twelve (11.2) with waters, day slots, shadow
  size, temperament, lengths, rarity; moonfish on clear nights, rain eel after rain, one old king
  per lake at dusk; rain lifts the rarer bands
- school.ts: shadows as seeded agents (7 in a jetty's zone, 2 elsewhere), fleeing splashes;
  waterAt() from World.shape (fishable deeper than 0.4 m, not frozen; stream / oasis / lake)
- angling.ts: hold 0.3-1.2 s -> 4-14 m; a shadow within 1.5 m comes; 4-20 s (bait halves),
  0-3 nibbles, bite window 0.9 s (rare 0.6 s); runs left / right / out by temperament, the right
  counter tires it, reeling during a run loads the line, full 1.5 s snaps it; 15 % of hooks are
  junk (boot) or a bottle with a note; one in ten fish is a big one; serialisable, fixed 1/60 s
- angler.ts: competent and careless robot anglers
- catalogue: tool.rod (medium, new 'rod' shape, uncommon, in tackle boxes), keep.bottle
- harness/sim/fishing.ts (measure -> activities_fishing) + specs/activities/fishing.json, tests

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/harness/sim/fishing.test.ts b/harness/sim/fishing.test.ts
